a) GET RESPONSE after reset: 6f00
b) SELECT MF: 612b
b) GET RESPONSE, P3 too long: 6c2b
b) GET RESPONSE: 9000, 43 bytes
c) GET RESPONSE repeated: 6f00
d) GET RESPONSE after STATUS without data: 6f00
e) GET RESPONSE after an intervening command: 6f00
f) GET RESPONSE after 6Cxx and an intervening command: 6f00
g) GET RESPONSE after a command on a closed lchan: 6f00
